translation.environmentsSettings.repoAccess.pathHint	To see why a repository is missing, enter its full path, such as github.com/owner/repo or gitlab.com/group/project.
translation.environmentsSettings.repoAccess.pageTitle	Check access to a repository
translation.environmentsSettings.repoAccess.pageDescription	If a repository you use is not listed here, enter its full path to see why you cannot use it in Devin.
translation.environmentsSettings.repoAccess.pageOk	You have access to this repository in Devin. An environment that includes it is listed on the Environments page when you have access to all of its repositories.
translation.environmentsSettings.repoAccess.check	Check why it is missing
translation.environmentsSettings.repoAccess.checkAgain	Check again
translation.environmentsSettings.repoAccess.checkFailed	Could not check this repository. Try again.
translation.environmentsSettings.repoAccess.ok	You have access to this repository. It may already be in this environment; otherwise search for it by name.
translation.environmentsSettings.repoAccess.hostNotConnected	Devin has no connection to {{host}}. Ask a Devin admin to connect it.
translation.environmentsSettings.repoAccess.providerNotSupported	This check only covers GitLab and GitHub repositories. For other Git providers, ask a Devin admin.
translation.environmentsSettings.repoAccess.unknown	Devin cannot tell why this repository is unavailable. Check the path, or ask a Devin admin.
translation.environmentsSettings.repoAccess.linkAccount	Repositories you can access on {{host}} are listed once your {{provider}} account is linked. <connectionsLink>Link your {{provider}} account</connectionsLink>.
translation.environmentsSettings.repoAccess.askAdmin	If a repository you expect is missing, ask a Devin admin whether it is connected to Devin and whether you have access to it.
translation.environmentsSettings.repoAccess.gitlab.identityNotLinked	Devin cannot match your GitLab access because your GitLab account is not linked. <connectionsLink>Link it in your connections</connectionsLink>, then check again.
translation.environmentsSettings.repoAccess.gitlab.notFound	GitLab did not find a repository at this path for your linked account. Check the path. If the repository exists, ask a project maintainer for access.
translation.environmentsSettings.repoAccess.gitlab.providerRoleTooLow	Your GitLab role on this project is too low. Ask a project maintainer for at least the Reporter role.
translation.environmentsSettings.repoAccess.gitlab.notCovered	This repository is not connected to Devin. Ask a project maintainer to add it to Devin.
translation.environmentsSettings.repoAccess.gitlab.openMembers	Open project members
translation.environmentsSettings.repoAccess.gitlab.pendingSync	You have access to this repository in GitLab, but not in Devin yet.
translation.environmentsSettings.repoAccess.gitlab.hostFailed	Could not search this host. Try again, or link your GitLab account again.
translation.environmentsSettings.repoAccess.gitlab.noMatches	No matching projects where your role is Reporter or higher.
translation.environmentsSettings.repoAccess.gitlab.howToConnect	Ask a project maintainer to add it to Devin.
translation.environmentsSettings.repoAccess.github.identityNotLinked	Devin cannot match your GitHub access because your GitHub account is not linked. <connectionsLink>Link it in your connections</connectionsLink>, then check again.
translation.environmentsSettings.repoAccess.github.notFound	GitHub did not find a repository at this path that both your linked account and the Devin GitHub App can read. Check the path. If the repository exists, ask a repository admin or organization owner for access and to add it to the Devin GitHub App installation.
translation.environmentsSettings.repoAccess.github.providerRoleTooLow	Your GitHub role on this repository does not include its code. Ask a repository admin for read access.
translation.environmentsSettings.repoAccess.github.notCovered	This repository is not connected to Devin. Ask a repository admin or organization owner to add it to the Devin GitHub App installation.
translation.environmentsSettings.repoAccess.github.openMembers	Open repository access settings
translation.environmentsSettings.repoAccess.github.pendingSync	You have access to this repository in GitHub, but not in Devin yet. Check again in a few minutes; if nothing changes, ask a Devin admin.
translation.environmentsSettings.repoAccess.github.hostFailed	Could not search this host. Try again, or link your GitHub account again.
translation.environmentsSettings.repoAccess.github.noMatches	No matching repositories that both you and the Devin GitHub App can read. If yours is missing, ask a repository admin or organization owner to add it to the Devin GitHub App installation.
translation.environmentsSettings.repoAccess.github.howToConnect	Ask a repository admin or organization owner to add it to the Devin GitHub App installation.
translation.environmentsSettings.repoAccess.search.button	Search my repositories
translation.environmentsSettings.repoAccess.search.orPathHint	or enter its full path, such as github.com/owner/repo.
translation.environmentsSettings.repoAccess.search.failed	Could not search. Try again.
translation.environmentsSettings.repoAccess.search.noSearchableHosts	Devin has no GitLab or GitHub connection to search.
translation.environmentsSettings.repoAccess.search.hostNotLinked	Not searched: your {{provider}} account on this host is not linked. <connectionsLink>Link it in your connections</connectionsLink>.
translation.environmentsSettings.repoAccess.search.matchOk	Available in Devin
translation.environmentsSettings.repoAccess.search.matchPendingSync	Your access is not in Devin yet
translation.environmentsSettings.repoAccess.search.matchConnected	Connected to Devin. If you can't select it, ask a Devin admin for access.
translation.environmentsSettings.repoAccess.search.matchNotCovered	Not connected to Devin
translation.environmentsSettings.repoAccess.search.hasMore_one	Showing the first match. Type more of the name to narrow the search.
translation.environmentsSettings.repoAccess.search.hasMore_other	Showing the first {{count}} matches. Type more of the name to narrow the search.
translation.environmentsSettings.repoAccess.search.howToConnectNoSync	Ask a Devin admin to add it to Devin.
